  m_Name: Quest_TaraWatch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestDefinition
  questId: tara_watch_quest
  npcName: Tara
  itemDisplayName: Tara's Watch
  locationHint: It slipped off near the water line next to the pier.
  itemIdToUnlock: tara_watch
  storyFlagIdOnComplete: tara_watch_returned
  availableFromDay: 1
  requiredCompletedQuestId: 
  offerWindows: []
  dialogueLines:
  - Darn it! I lost my watch. Would you be a sweet heart and find it for me?
  - I think it slipped off near the pier, somewhere along the water line...
  - Pleeeeease get me back my watch! I'll give you a special reward for it. Teehee!
  searchingDialogueLines:
  - Any luck finding my watch yet?
  - Check near the pier, along the water line. That's where I last had it!
  turnInDialogueLines:
  - You found it! Oh thank you, thank you!
  - "My watch means everything to me. Here \u2014 take this star as thanks!"
  completedDialogueLines:
  - Thanks again for finding my watch!
  - You're the best. I feel so much better now.
  day2CompletedDialogueLines:
  - Good morning! Still can't believe you found my watch yesterday.
  - I've been telling everyone how kind you are. Enjoy the rest of your day at the
    beach!
  day2IncompleteDialogueLines:
  - Oh no, another day and I still don't have my watch...
  - "I was really hoping someone would help me. It's near the pier \u2014 please,
    will you look for it?"
  day3PerfectDialogueLines:
  - Today is our wedding day! I can't believe everything worked out.
  - Thank you for finding my watch when it mattered most. You're invited to celebrate
    with us!
  day3LateDialogueLines:
  - "Tom and I are together thanks to you \u2014 even if this week got a little messy."
  - Better late than never, right? Thanks again for the watch.
  completedDialogueVariants:
